  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p style='box-sizing:border-box; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin-top:0px; color:rgb(76, 76, 78); font-size:14px; text-align:justify;'><font face='Open Sans, Arial, sans-serif' style='box-sizing:border-box;'>The Early Development Index (EDI) is designed for use with whole populations based on geographical or administrative boundaries. It is a questionnaire completed by kindergarten teachers for each student in senior kindergarten. One of the key measures of the EDI is the percentage of children who are vulnerable, which captures those that may be struggling to meet developmental milestones but have not been formally identified.  This population level data helps inform programs and policies that support healthy child development for all. For more information about the Childcare and Early Years programs, please visit the City of Kingston <a href='https://www.cityofkingston.ca/residents/community-services/childcare' style='box-sizing:border-box; background-color:transparent; text-decoration-line:none; color:rgb(0, 70, 79);' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>website</a>.</font></p><p style='box-sizing:border-box; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; color:rgb(76, 76, 78); font-size:14px; text-align:justify;'><font face='Open Sans, Arial, sans-serif' style='box-sizing:border-box;'>The EDI was developed by researchers at the Offord Centre for Child Studies at McMaster University (<a href='https://efts.offordcentre.com/' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>https://efts.offordcentre.com/</a>). Data was provided by the Ontario Ministry of Education and prepared by the City of Kingston. This dataset is designed to be interpreted at the group level only.</font></p><p style='box-sizing:border-box; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; color:rgb(76, 76, 78); font-size:14px; text-align:justify;'><font face='Open Sans, Arial, sans-serif' style='box-sizing:border-box;'><br /></font></p><p style='box-sizing:border-box; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; color:rgb(76, 76, 78); font-size:14px; text-align:justify;'><font face='Open Sans, Arial, sans-serif' style='box-sizing:border-box;'><b>Field                Description</b></font></p><div style='color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size:medium;'><table style='border-collapse:collapse; width:679pt;' width='905'><tbody><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:Calibri, sans-serif; border:none; width:70pt; height:15pt;' width='93'>cycle</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; width:609pt;' width='812'>Iteration of the provincial data collection</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:Calibri, sans-serif; border:none; height:15pt;'>year</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none;'>Year of completion</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; width:70pt; height:15pt;' width='93'>ey_region</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none;'>Geography - KFLA Early Years region ID</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:Calibri, sans-serif; border:none; height:15pt;'>description</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none;'>Geography description of regions</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; width:70pt; height:15pt;' width='93'>total</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; color:windowtext; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none;'>Total EDI's records completed within area</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; width:70pt; height:15pt;' width='93'>vfa</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none;'>Records valid for analysis excluding special needs</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; width:70pt; height:15pt;' width='93'>female</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:Aptos, sans-serif; border:none; width:609pt;' width='812'>Child's gender - female (verified by the Ministry of Education)</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; width:70pt; height:15pt;' width='93'>male</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:Aptos, sans-serif; border:none; width:609pt;' width='812'>Child's gender - male (verified by the Ministry of Education)</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; width:70pt; height:15pt;' width='93'>mean_age</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none;'>Median age of all children within region at completion</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; width:70pt; height:15pt;' width='93'>mean_abs</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none;'>Median number of days absent </td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; width:70pt; height:15pt;' width='93'>ell</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:Aptos, sans-serif; border:none; width:609pt;' width='812'>English Language Learner</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; width:70pt; height:15pt;' width='93'>fr_Imm</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:Aptos, sans-serif; border:none; width:609pt;' width='812'>French Immersion</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; width:70pt; height:15pt;' width='93'>fur_ass</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:Aptos, sans-serif; border:none; width:609pt;' width='812'>Children requiring further assessment</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; height:15pt;'>olow_phwb</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; color:windowtext; font-size:11pt; font-family:Aptos, sans-serif; border:none; width:609pt;' width='812'>Vulnerable in the physical healthy and well-being domain (below the 10th percentile)</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; height:15pt;'>olow_soc</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; color:windowtext; font-size:11pt; font-family:Aptos, sans-serif; border:none; width:609pt;' width='812'>Vulnerable in the  social competence domain (below the 10th percentile)</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; height:15pt;'>olow_em</td><td style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; color:windowtext; font-size:11pt; font-family:Aptos, sans-serif; border:none; width:609pt;' width='812'>Vulnerable in the  emotional maturity domain (below the 10th percentile)</td></tr><tr height='20' style='height:15pt;'><td height='20' style='padding-top:1px; padding-right:1px; padding-left:1px; font-size:11pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;, sans-serif; border:none; height:15pt;'>olow_lc</td><td st